  "description": "The Urban Lady 24\" 3 Speed is a great option for those women or children under 5ft. tall or hovering around the 5ft. mark. This is a simple, durable cruiser at an affordable price that has been a best seller for Firmstrong since opening. The wheel size is 24\" and the frame is 13.5\" making it slightly smaller than a full size cruiser. It is great for riders who don't feel comfortable on a 24\" and would like to have more control and feel more stable on their bicycle. Color matched fenders are also available for purchase for this cruiser. This cruiser is great for all types of riding and will last a long time. The three speed is a Shimano Nexus Internal 3 Speed Hub which is best internal 3 speed on the market. It shifts smooth and easy with the twist of your wrist, making uphill and long rides easy and enjoyable.\n\n13.5” Steel Frame with 24” Aluminum Wheels\n\nFits Most Girls & Women 4’ – 5’2” Tall\n\n3 Speed Ladies Bike with Shimano Internal Gear System, shifts quickly and easily and requires little maintenance\n\nPedal-Backwards Coaster Brake for easy pedaling and smooth braking\n\nDual Spring Oversized Seat for Added Comfort\n\n2.125” Wide White-Wall Tires provides a cushioned, relaxed ride for easy rolling\n\n28.5” Wide Cruiser Bike Handlebars with Rubber Grips\n\nBicycle Weighs 38lbs. Fully Assembled\n\nRecommended Riding Speed 3 – 25mph\n\nRecommended Riding Distance 0 – 35 miles in a single trip\n\nThe Seat and Handlebar Height and Tilt can be adjusted to properly fit the rider\n\nColor Matched Fenders can be Purchased Separately for $49.99.\n\nBike comes 80% Assembled, Assembly is easy and fun!\n\nDesigned in Hermosa Beach, CA",
